*OpenUI *Economode/Toner Saving: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 60 AnySetup *Economode
*DefaultEconomode: False
*Economode False/Off: "<</cupsInteger0 0>>setpagedevice"
*Economode True/On: "<</cupsInteger0 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Economode

